@baseUrl = https://localhost:7226
@accountId = opaque-trainer-id
@csrfToken = authenticated-session-token

### Use an existing GymAdmin cookie session. GET requires no CSRF header.
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/trainers?page=1&pageSize=20

### Obtain a fresh token after login; do not log it.
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/account/csrf

### Disable a same-gym Trainer (bodyless, 204); old cookies fail on their next request.
PATCH {{baseUrl}}/api/trainers/{{accountId}}/deactivate
X-CSRF-TOKEN: {{csrfToken}}

### Restore access (bodyless, 204), not old cookies, confirmation or credentials.
PATCH {{baseUrl}}/api/trainers/{{accountId}}/reactivate
X-CSRF-TOKEN: {{csrfToken}}
